{"4700690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Door or Blue Door?", "steam_appid": 4700690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700690/extras/b6a9cbcffb53efb14a004d3dd5281ed0.avif?t=1781753076\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Story and goal:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a cold cell with no memories. Each in-game day, you face a choice: the red door or the blue door. The right path leads forward, the wrong one - a gruesome death. Your goal is to survive 14 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gameplay and challenge:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one choice per day - the consequences are always different. One mistake resets your progress completely - you start from day one with no saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique feature:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror here doesn't come from jump scares - it comes from the fact that any mistake is your last. You start over. The only way to win is to remember which doors have killed you before, and keep trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Playtime:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On average, 30 minutes. It depends on your ability to make mistakes and learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Welcome to a terrifying puzzle with no right to make a mistake. Every move you make is being recorded. And someone really wants you to fail.</strong></i></u></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700690/extras/b6a9cbcffb53efb14a004d3dd5281ed0.avif?t=1781753076\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Story and goal:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a cold cell with no memories. Each in-game day, you face a choice: the red door or the blue door. The right path leads forward, the wrong one - a gruesome death. Your goal is to survive 14 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gameplay and challenge:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one choice per day - the consequences are always different. One mistake resets your progress completely - you start from day one with no saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique feature:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror here doesn't come from jump scares - it comes from the fact that any mistake is your last. You start over. The only way to win is to remember which doors have killed you before, and keep trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Playtime:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On average, 30 minutes. It depends on your ability to make mistakes and learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Welcome to a terrifying puzzle with no right to make a mistake. Every move you make is being recorded. And someone really wants you to fail.</strong></i></u></p>", "short_description": "This is a psychological horror where for 14 days in a row you have to choose either a red door or a blue door. Make even one mistake - you die, and you have to start all over! Welcome to a terrifying puzzle with no room for error. And know this: someone is watching you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "he